0.05, ** <italic>P </italic>&#x0003c; 0.01, *** <italic>P </italic>&#x0003c; 0.001, saline-treated rats versus na&#x000ef;ve control. &#x02020; <italic>P </italic>&#x0003c; 0.05, &#x02020;&#x02020; <italic>P </italic>&#x0003c; 0.01, &#x02020;&#x02020;&#x02020; <italic>P </italic>&#x0003c; 0.001, bee venom-treated rats versus na&#x000ef;ve control.</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="T2"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Region- or state-related differences in activation of ERK2 in na&#x000ef;ve and pain-experiencing rats.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><td></td><td align="center" colspan="3">Spinal cord dorsal horn</td><td align="center" colspan="3">S1 area of cortex</td><td align="center" colspan="3">Hippocampus</td></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan="9"><hr></hr></td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="left">Na&#x000ef;ve</td><td align="left">Saline</td><td align="left">Bee venom</td><td align="left">Na&#x000ef;ve</td><td align="left">Saline</td><td align="left">Bee venom</td><td align="left">Na&#x000ef;ve</td><td align="left">Saline</td><td align="left">Bee venom</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">5 min</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Ipsil</td><td align="left">0.01 &#x000b1; 0.01</td><td align="left">1.40 &#x000b1; 0.74*</td><td align="left">1.32 &#x000b1; 0.51&#x02020;</td><td align="left">0.43 &#x000b1; 0.08</td><td align="left">1.03 &#x000b1; 0.31</td><td align="left">0.85 &#x000b1; 0.18</td><td align="left">0.53 &#x000b1; 0.18</td><td align="left">0.61 &#x000b1; 0.29</td><td align="left">0.81 &#x000b1; 0.13</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Contl</td><td align="left">0.02 &#x000b1; 5.12 &#x000d7; 10<sup>-3</sup></td><td align="left">1.80 &#x000b1; 0.36**</td><td align="left">1.93 &#x000b1; 0.36&#x02020;&#x02020;</td><td align="left">0.36 &#x000b1; 0.05</td><td align="left">0.86 &#x000b1; 0.20</td><td align="l